## 5. User Flows

### 5.1 Onboarding Flow

```
App Launch
    ↓
Splash Screen (Logo + Animation)
    ↓
Sign Up / Login Screen
    ↓
[Sign Up Path]
    → Social Login (Google/Facebook/Apple)
    → OR Email Sign Up
    → Phone Verification (Optional)
    → Profile Setup
    ↓
Home Screen (Events Feed)
```

### 5.2 Event Creation Flow

```
Tap "+" Button (from Events page)
    ↓
Event Creation Form
    → Add Title
    → Add Description
    → Set Date & Time
    → Set Location
    → Add Cover Image
    → Set Privacy (Public/Private)
    → Add Agenda (Optional)
    ↓
Preview & Publish
    ↓
Share Event / Invite Friends
```

### 5.3 Messaging Flow

```
Tap "+" Button (from Messages page)
    ↓
New Message Modal
    → Search Contacts
    → OR Create New Group
    → OR Add New Contact
    ↓
Select Contact
    ↓
Open Chat (Existing or New)
    ↓
Send Messages
```

### 5.4 Event RSVP Flow

```
View Event Card
    ↓
Tap to Open Event Details
    ↓
View Full Description, Location, Attendees
    ↓
Tap RSVP Button
    → Going / Maybe / Not Going
    ↓
Join Event Chat (Optional)
```

