## 6. Technical Architecture

### 6.1 Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| **Mobile App** | React Native + Expo |
| **Web App** | Next.js + React |
| **Shared Code** | TypeScript (monorepo with pnpm) |
| **Backend** | Supabase (Auth, Database, Storage) |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL (via Supabase) |
| **Real-time** | Supabase Realtime |
| **Storage** | Supabase Storage |
| **Maps** | OpenStreetMap / Google Maps |
| **State Management** | React Query |
| **Styling** | StyleSheet (Mobile), Tailwind CSS (Web) |

### 6.2 Project Structure

```
GatherUp/
├── apps/
│   ├── mobile/          # React Native + Expo
│   └── web/             # Next.js
├── packages/
│   └── shared/          # Shared TypeScript code
│       ├── api/         # API client functions
│       ├── hooks/       # Shared React hooks
│       ├── types/       # TypeScript types
│       └── utils/       # Utility functions
└── supabase/
    └── migrations/      # Database migrations
```

### 6.3 Database Schema (Core Tables)

| Table | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| `users` | User profiles and authentication |
| `events` | Event details and metadata |
| `event_attendees` | RSVP status for events |
| `messages` | Chat messages |
| `conversations` | Chat threads (1:1 and group) |
| `contacts` | User contact relationships |
| `notifications` | In-app notifications |

### 6.4 Security

- Row Level Security (RLS) on all tables
- JWT-based authentication
- HTTPS for all communications
- Secure storage for tokens

