## Appendix

### A. Glossary

| Term | Definition |
|------|------------|
| **Event** | A scheduled gathering created by a user |
| **RSVP** | Response to event invitation (Going/Maybe/Not Going) |
| **Host** | User who created an event |
| **Attendee** | User who RSVPs to an event |
| **Event Chat** | Group conversation tied to an event |
| **Personal Chat** | 1:1 direct message conversation |

